{"symbol":"VPL","yahoo":"VPL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Vrundavan Plantation Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","website":"https://vrundavanplantation.com","about":"Vrundavan Plantation Limited engages in the nursery business. Its plantation includes big trees, ground covers, shrubs, climber, indoor, and ornamental plants, etc. The company's services comprise horticulture and landscape maintenance services, including lawn mowing, brush and jungle clearing, hedge trimming, pruning, watering of roadside plantations, and maintenance of landscaped areas. In addition, it also undertakes annual and long-term landscape maintenance contracts for residential, commercial, industrial, institutional, and government organizations. It also trades in pots, including plastic pots, terracotta pots, self-watering pots, hanging pots, and vertical gardens, such as pots of different materials with ceramic, etc; gardening tools and accessories; and garden inputs, consisting of plant food, organic pesticides, potting mixes, nutrients, etc. The company serves corporates, institutions, hospitality, residential, governments, and semi governments sectors. The company was founded in 1997 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T08:45:52+00:00","quote":{"price":38.0,"prevClose":36.99,"marketCap":23.52,"high52":53.95,"low52":30.1,"pe":12.62,"bookValue":46.62,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":6.74,"shares":0.619,"insiders":68.24,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-11-06","2023-11-07","2023-11-08","2023-11-09","2023-11-10","2023-11-13","2023-11-15","2023-11-16","2023-11-17","2023-11-20","2023-11-21","2023-11-22","2023-11-23","2023-11-24","2023-11-28","2023-11-29","2023-11-30","2023-12-01","2023-12-04","2023-12-05","2023-12-06","2023-12-07","2023-12-08","2023-12-11","2023-12-12","2023-12-13","2023-12-14","2023-12-15","2023-12-18","2023-12-19","2023-12-20","2023-12-21","2023-12-22","2023-12-26","2023-12-27","2023-12-28","2023-12-29","